    <string name="direct_title">Direct write (experimental)</string>
    <string name="direct_intro">Writes one Android Auto flag override straight into Play Services\' database, without AA Experiments. This follows an untested proposal for the new database layout, so it may have no effect. Every change is confirmed and backed up first, and only Android Auto\'s rows are touched.\n\nIf the same flag is also overridden in AA Experiments, that one wins.</string>
